 V, STRAIGHT THROUGH" (at 116.84 220.98 0) (effects (font (size 2.0 2.0)) (justify left)) (uuid "3015bc35-966b-4026-b9f5-27e65a270c40"))(text "The MPG runs at 5 V and shares ground with the port, so it needs no" (at 116.84 231.14 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left)) (uuid "b4486798-1081-4c51-8c9d-d73098e62e81"))(text "optocoupler - only a series resistor and a pull-up, because most" (at 116.84 236.22 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left)) (uuid "af50ed56-3743-4aa8-aea6-fb9c6503ebf2"))(text "handwheels drive their outputs open-collector." (at 116.84 241.3 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left)) (uuid "1b872d52-d637-4a73-9c69-44fe338e0d12"))(wire (pts (xy 154.94 267.97)(xy 162.56 267.97)) (stroke (width 0) (type default)) (uuid "fd05987e-3d93-47b7-a96d-ba9a512fbde1"))(global_label "+5V" (shape passive) (at 162.56 267.97 180) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left)) (uuid "32b18361-d475-43c6-9ac9-a4d7fc32f02d"))(wire (pts (xy 154.94 265.43)(xy 162.56 265.43)) (stroke (width 0) (type default)) (uuid "079fa6c6-c8c2-432b-9e6e-abb417c2829a"))(global_label "GND" (shape passive) (at 162.56 265.43 180) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left)) (uuid "cef80467-00c7-4e35-8c67-25741afe9487"))(wire (pts (xy 154.94 262.89)(xy 162.56 262.89)) (stroke (width 0) (type default)) (uuid "f650f788-2cf2-4f75-b5da-54886d175c24"))(global_label "MPG_A_RAW" (shape passive) (at 162.56 262.89 180) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left)) (uuid "0775496c-c9c9-4941-ae4f-4007119a5c6b"))(wire (pts (xy 228.6 259.08)(xy 228.6 251.46)) (stroke (width 0) (type default)) (uuid "9b2914f7-8a01-4a06-9f65-3765f5a2cc28"))(global_label "MPG_A_RAW" (shape passive) (at 228.6 251.46 90) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left)) (uuid "e6a65746-fe8c-4c8a-9fd2-73a7cf224b0b"))(wire (pts (xy 228.6 266.7)(xy 228.6 274.32)) (stroke (width 0) (type default)) (uuid "da2b8185-132e-43a3-b2b9-8555f29c54a0"))(global_label "MPG_A_PC" (shape passive) (at 22